    <DataNode elementId="CPD66-39" textLabel="a 2,3,4-saturated fatty acid" type="Metabolite">
      <Xref identifier="71627" dataSource="ChEBI" />
      <Graphics centerX="602.9342041015625" centerY="723.23583984375" width="90.0" height="25.0" textColor="3955e7" fontName="Arial" fontWeight="Normal" fontStyle="Normal" fontDecoration="Normal" fontStrikethru="Normal" fontSize="12" hAlign="Center" vAlign="Middle" borderColor="3955e7" borderStyle="Solid" borderWidth="1.0" fillColor="FFFFFF" shapeType="Rectangle" />
      <Comment source="SRI, trupp">|FRAME: Fatty-Acids &quot;A fatty acid&quot;| is a carboxylic acid with a long unbranched aliphatic tail. This class describes |FRAME: Fatty-Acids &quot;fatty acids&quot;| that do not contain any double bonds in the 2, 3, and 4 positions. The compounds in this class are often classified by the length of their aliphatic chains. |FRAME: Short-Chain-234-Saturated-Fatty-Acids &quot;Short-chain 2,3,4-saturated fatty acids&quot;| are 2,3,4-saturated fatty acids with aliphatic chains of less than 6 carbons. |FRAME: Medium-Chain-234-Saturated-Fatty-Acids &quot;Medium-chain 2,3,4-saturated fatty acids&quot;| are 2,3,4-saturated fatty acids with aliphatic chain of 6-12 carbons. |FRAME: Long-Chain-234-Saturated-Fatty-Acids &quot;Long-chain 2,3,4-saturated fatty acids&quot;| are 2,3,4-saturated fatty acids with aliphatic chains of 13-22 carbons. |FRAME: Very-Long-Chain-234-Saturated-FAs &quot;Very-long-chain 2,3,4-saturated fatty acids&quot;| are 2,3,4-saturated fatty acids with aliphatic chains of 23 carbons or longer.</Comment>
